[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6307.109, "timestamp": "01:45:07", "text": "所以，我不想养狗。 我是个键盘侠。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6309.022, "timestamp": "01:45:09", "text": "呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6310.55, "timestamp": "01:45:10", "text": "（嗤笑）是啊，我得把它带走"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6324.95, "timestamp": "01:45:24", "text": "最好的办法是取下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6327.59, "timestamp": "01:45:27", "text": "三脚架再拍，而"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6330.95, "timestamp": "01:45:30", "text": "不是像之前那样拿着三脚架开着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6338.55, "timestamp": "01:45:38", "text": "闪光灯拍。[嗤笑]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6340.47, "timestamp": "01:45:40", "text": "但让我试试看能不能做到。 事情最终会朝着"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6343.43, "timestamp": "01:45:43", "text": "这个方向发展。   就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6345.99, "timestamp": "01:45:45", "text": "好的。 在我动手之前，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6349.75, "timestamp": "01:45:49", "text": "让我先把东西锁好。 锁定画布。"}]